@startuml domain-sessions
title Sessions, participation and reliability

top to bottom direction
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<AggregateRoot>> #DBEAFE
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<ValueObject>> #DCFCE7
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<RoleView>> #F3E8FF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40

class Session <<AggregateRoot>> {
  +sessionId : UUID
  +bookerId : UUID
  +invitedGroupId : UUID [0..1]
  +holdingAccountId : UUID
  +status : SessionStatus
  +visibility : Visibility
  +totalSlots : number
  +minimumReliability : ReliabilityScore [0..1]
  +pendingSettlement : SettlementBatch [0..1]
  --
  {static} +create(...) : Session
  +admitParticipant(participant, ...) : AdmissionResult
  +promoteNext(participant, ...) : PromotionResult
  +applyParticipantWithdrawal(participant, ...) : WithdrawalResult
  +removeWaitlistedParticipant(participant, ...) : void
  +releaseParticipantReplacement(participant, ...) : FinancialResult
  +cancel(...) : FinancialResult
  +verifyAttendance(...) : void
  +prepareSettlement(...) : SettlementBatch [0..1]
  +completeSettlement(...) : FinancialResult
  +failSettlement(...) : void
}

class Participant <<RoleView>> {
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +join(session, ...) : AdmissionResult
  +withdraw(session, ...) : WithdrawalResult
  +leaveWaitlist(session, ...) : void
  +offerReplacementToWaitlist(session, ...) : FinancialResult
}

class Booking <<ValueObject>> {
  +venueName : string
  +region : Region
  +sport : Sport
  +startAt : Date
  +endAt : Date
  +totalCost : Money
  --
  +hasStarted(...) : boolean
  +hasEnded(...) : boolean
}

class Participation <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +participationId : UUID
  +userId : UUID
  +status : ParticipationStatus
  +attendance : AttendanceStatus
  +queueSequence : number [0..1]
  +replacesParticipationId : UUID [0..1]
  --
  +commit(...) : Participation
  +withdraw(...) : Participation
  +verify(...) : Participation
  +reliabilityOutcome(...) : ReliabilityOutcome [0..1]
}

class FundHold <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +holdId : UUID
  +participationId : UUID
  +walletId : UUID
  +holdingAccountId : UUID
  +payoutId : UUID [0..1]
  +amount : Money
  +state : HoldState
  --
  +awaitReplacement() : FundHold
  +refund(...) : FundHold
  +release(...) : FundHold
  +forfeit(...) : FundHold
}

class ReliabilityScore <<ValueObject>> {
  {static} +from(...) : ReliabilityScore
  {static} +fromHistory(...) : ReliabilityScore
  +toNumber() : number
  +meetsMinimum(...) : boolean
}

Session "1" *-down- "1" Booking : booking
Participant .down.> Session : requests guarded roster change
Session "1" *-down- "0..*" Participation : participations
Participation "1" *-down- "0..1" FundHold : hold
ReliabilityScore .up.> Participation : finalized outcomes
Booking -[hidden]right- Participation
FundHold -[hidden]right- ReliabilityScore

caption Selected public members; (...) abbreviates parameters.\nSession invokes Participant's eligibility, funding and departure calculations before applying changes.\nSession owns its pending settlement snapshot; the settlement view expands that contract.
@enduml
